Z||000002||Tigger||08-25-2001||12:36 AM||||Check to see if the ECM is throwing engine codes.  To check is easy, do a search on "checking engine codes" or something similar since this has been covered a few times.  A Hayne's manual has the steps to check and the description of the codes.<P>If you can't find any info searching, just let us know.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 08-25-2001).]||||reg||1
